                },
                {
                  "id": "s3t5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Every Elite Support certified dealership is dedicated to unrivaled customer service and a commitment to continuous improvement. Major investments in facilities, equipment, personnel, parts inventory, and processes enable our staff to rapidly diagnose your concerns, make efficient repairs, and keep you informed. Add superior support from Freightliner and Western Star and you ultimately get more value.",
